      "reasons": [
        "The first sentence makes a broad general claim about electromyography itself, but the packet only supports surface electromyography (sEMG) in ALS-focused neuromuscular assessment, not a general definition of the technique.",
        "The packet supports signals recorded at rest and during voluntary contractions, but it does not support the fuller general description of electromyography as a method for studying muscle electrical activity in general.",
        "The second sentence is mostly supported, but it adds a generalized framing of sEMG as a neuromuscular assessment tool beyond the packet’s specific ALS review context."
